.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
orbit-ci - Point private repositories at the self-hosted pool and sync secrets


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit ci [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Move private repositories between GitHub-hosted runners and the organization's self-hosted pool, and push each repository's secrets without writing them to argv.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for ci


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBorbit(1)\fP, \fBorbit-ci-runner(1)\fP, \fBorbit-ci-secrets(1)\fP
